19. EXAM INPUT / OUTPUT CHEAT SHEET
-----------------------------------
NORMAL TEXT:
    input() -> STRING
    use .encode() before AES

HEX INPUT:
    input() -> STRING
    use bytes.fromhex() before AES

AES OUTPUT:
    encryption/decryption -> BYTES

DISPLAY CIPHERTEXT AS HEX:
    ciphertext.hex()

CONVERT HEX BACK TO BYTES:
    bytes.fromhex()

DISPLAY DECRYPTED NORMAL TEXT:
    decrypted.decode()

FILES:
    rb / wb
    data is already BYTES


